FailAt 21
Assign T: RAM:
Stack 16384
Echo "MTec sync SCSI read test. Reads only, nothing on the card is written."
Echo "==== MTecSync run" >>SYS:mtectest.log
If NOT EXISTS SYS:mtectest.log
  Echo "This floppy is write protected. Slide the tab and reboot."
  Quit 20
EndIf
MTecPatch >>SYS:mtectest.log
Version mtecscsi.device >>SYS:mtectest.log
Echo "Reading the disk layout"
Wait 5
MTecTest SCAN >RAM:step
Type RAM:step >>SYS:mtectest.log
Wait 5
If NOT EXISTS RAM:SyncTest
  Echo "No usable disk found. See SYS:mtectest.log"
  Quit 10
EndIf
Execute RAM:SyncTest
Echo "==== MTecSync finished" >>SYS:mtectest.log
Echo "Finished. Reboot, then send the log."
More SYS:mtectest.log
